Implemented. I kept scope to the requested #208 terrain texture-array path.

## Files changed

- [External/Compound-Spheres/CompoundSpheres/HeightFieldRenderer.cs](/E:/Dev/WorldSphereMod/External/Compound-Spheres/CompoundSpheres/HeightFieldRenderer.cs)  
  - Added texture-array aware duplicate-quad rendering path.
  - Samples `_sampleTexture` at tile-corner inputs, computes dominant corner texture indices, and uses that slice for duplicated quads via `TEXCOORD1`.
  - Added `_uvsSlice` upload path for texture slice (`SetUVs(1, _uvsSlice, ...)`).
  - Kept shared-corner path intact when `_UseTerrainTexArray` is off.

- [WorldSphereMod/Resources/Shaders/OpaqueVertexColor.shader](/E:/Dev/WorldSphereMod/WorldSphereMod/Resources/Shaders/OpaqueVertexColor.shader)  
  - Added `_TerrainTexArray` / `_UseTerrainTexArray`.
  - Added `uv1`/`texSlice` plumbing.
  - Added `sampler2DArray` sample branch to multiply by vertex tint and keep legacy `_MainTex` path.

- [Tools/Unity-Bake-Project/Assets/WSM3D/Shaders/OpaqueVertexColor.shader](/E:/Dev/WorldSphereMod/Tools/Unity-Bake-Project/Assets/WSM3D/Shaders/OpaqueVertexColor.shader)  
